{"product_id":"the-silent-man-v-2-the-abbey-mysteries-vol-2","title":"The Silent Man: v.2: The Abbey Mysteries: Vol 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen Lord Ralph's young daughter goes missing in the village, the gentlemute Bedwyn is arrested for murder and thrown into the Abbey dungeons. Gwynethand Hereward refuse to believe that this shy man could be responsible for such adespicible crime and set about trying to prove his innocence. While Bedwynlanguishes in prison the girl's father receives a ransom note - his daughter isalive after all. But part of the ransom is that he mustn't tell anyone. Howcan Hereward and Gwyneth persuade Lord Ralph to speak up so Bedwyn will bereleased?BLBeing published in partnership with the successful packaging company, WorkingPartners, who are responsible for such series as Animal Ark and DolphinDiaries. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Cherith Baldry \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780192753632 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44970816700569,"sku":"13RD9780192753632","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/70de042f4c1e7e6db8a4790acb0138c1.jpg?v=1752084649","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-silent-man-v-2-the-abbey-mysteries-vol-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}